---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm {SITE.shortName}, a software engineer and AI engineer. I build backend services, developer tooling
      and Kubernetes infrastructure, and I'm now going deeper into machine learning.
    </p>

    <h2>Outside of work</h2>
    <div class="outside">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Soccer:</strong> I love both playing and watching. My two teams are Atlanta United and the U.S. national teams.</li>
        <li><strong>Reading:</strong> Steinbeck is my favorite, especially <em>The Grapes of Wrath</em> and <em>The Winter of Our Discontent</em>, along with <em>Stoner</em> by John Williams. I'm also a fan of dystopian novels and a bit of Stephen King.</li>
        <li><strong>Video games:</strong> a good way to unwind.</li>
        <li><strong>Weightlifting:</strong> a steady part of my routine.</li>
        <li><strong>My cat:</strong> see image</li>
      </ul>
      <figure>
        <img src={`${base}${SITE.aboutImage.src}`} alt={SITE.aboutImage.alt} width="400" height="500" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>M.S. in Artificial Intelligence</strong>, University of Georgia (expected December 2027)</li>
      <li>
        <strong>B.S. in Computer Science</strong> and <strong>B.A. in Cognitive Science</strong>,
        University of Georgia (August 2020)
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Software Engineer II, NCR Voyix</li>
      <li>Software Engineer, Backend, FlightAware</li>
      <li>Computer Scientist, U.S. Department of Defense</li>
      <li>Teaching Assistant, University of Georgia</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, C++, Go, Rust, Java, TypeScript, SQL</li>
      <li><strong>AI / ML:</strong> PyTorch, TensorFlow, deep learning, computer vision</li>
      <li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Kubernetes, Docker, Nix, Flux, Linux, GCP (IAM), Grafana, observability (logs and metrics)</li>
      <li><strong>Engineering:</strong> Git, CI/CD (GitHub Actions, Jenkins), backend services and APIs, PostgreSQL, database migrations, testing, technical documentation</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      You can find me on <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a> and <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .outside { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; }
  .outside ul { margin: 0; }
  .outside figure { margin: 0; justify-self: center; width: min(100%, 260px); }
  .outside img {
    display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }
  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .outside { grid-template-columns: 1fr 240px; gap: 2rem; }
    .outside figure { justify-self: end; width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
